        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 4010/300-US32D, Brushed Stainless Steel 8 Inch Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis brushed stainless steel door pull has 8\" Center to Center mounting points with a total length of 9\". Most often used on commercial doors such as store entry doors and restaurant doors, it is easy to install and easy to maintain. Made by Omnia, the Satin Stainless Steel 8 Inch Handle will be sure to last for years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-stainless-steel-door-pull-omnia-4010-400-us32d\"><b>12\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/16-inch-stainless-steel-door-pull-omnia-4010-500-us32d\"><b>16\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 4010/300-US32D Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8\" (300 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-pull-mounting-btb.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Pull Back to Back Mounting Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<BR><BR>\r\n<p><B>***THIS ITEM IS DISCONTINUED, LIMITED STOCK AVAILABLE***</b></p>\r\n<BR><BR>",
